<h2><a name="Research"><i>Present</i></a>
<img src="http://www-cs.stanford.edu/gifs/button.books.gif" ALT="Mov">
</h2>

Ed is a Ph.d candidate in 
<a href="http://www-ee.stanford.edu/ee.html">Electrical Engineering Dept.</a>, 
<a href="http://www.stanford.edu/">Stanford University.</a>
He is working with 
<br>
Prof. <a href="http://www-db.stanford.edu/people/hector.html"> Hector Garcia-Molina  </a>
in the 
<a href="http://www-diglib.stanford.edu/diglib/">
Digital Library Project </a> in the
<a href="http://www-db.stanford.edu">
Database Group</a>, <a href="http://www-cs.stanford.edu">
Computer Science Dept.</a>.  
<br>
His research interests are in
Database and Multimedia Systems.

